OL,3,GNEWSARam-raided supermarket gets
OL,4,Aartistic facelift
OL,5,
OL,6,FStudents, community groups and
OL,7,Fvolunteers have come together to help
OL,8,Fspruce up the front of a supermarket
OL,9,Fdamaged in a ram raid.
OL,11,FIn OMOcMOtMOoMObMOeMOrMO, a telehandler
OL,12,Fwas driven into the Co-op on High
OL,13,FStreet in Shipston-on-Stour and an ATM
OL,14,Fmachine was removed, causing extensive
OL,15,Fdamage to the store.
OL,17,FResident Sara Walsh came up with the
OL,18,Fidea to transform the wooden hoarding
OL,19,Fwith artwork created by the community.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
