OL,3,GNEWSARam-raided supermarket gets
OL,4,Aartistic facelift
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said: "After the ram raid, we
OL,7,Fwanted to do something positive for our
OL,8,Flocal Co-op team and the town - the
OL,9,Fidea was simple: bring people together
OL,10,Fto turn the temporary frontage into a
OL,11,Fcelebration of Shipston."
